   $q$What can the reader tell about the speaker from the last stanza?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The speaker forgot the book at the library.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"The speaker is eager to start reading the book.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The speaker plans to return the book tomorrow.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"The speaker does not enjoy reading very much.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"opposite-meaning"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The speaker is eager to start reading the book.$q$, $q$The speaker tucks the book away "with care" and plans to read it "before the morning work's begun," which shows eagerness. Nothing says the book goes back tomorrow; the speaker plans to read it then.$q$, 'draft', '67bf4cfb-de26-5c06-a53e-b3394cd3abe7')
